{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TensorProductView","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"First","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Second","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vertices and their indices are as in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CartesianProductView"},{"type":"text","text":". The row of (g, h) lists "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(g′, h′)"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each entry g′ of G’s row of g and each entry h′ of H’s row of h, G outer. Rows are computed from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the factors’ index rows and never hash."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An edge’s position is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position(first: e, second: f, reversed:)"},{"type":"text","text":": G’s edge "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"e"},{"type":"text","text":" and H’s edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"f"},{"type":"text","text":". In an undirected product two non-loop edges {a, b} and {c, d} give two edges, the straight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"{(a, c), (b, d)} and the reversed {(a, d), (b, c)}, where a, c are the edges’ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"type":"text","text":" ends; when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either is a self-loop they coincide and there is one, not reversed. A row lists a factor"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"self-loop from its first appearance only, so every product edge has each of its ends once in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the rows. Directed, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reversed"},{"type":"text","text":" is always false, and the product has edge indices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index(e)·m_H + index(f)"},{"type":"text","text":" when both factors have them; undirected it has none, because a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"self-loop changes how many edges a factor pair gives."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/DirectedEdges","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/EdgeRow","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/IndexRow","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/Position","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/UndirectedEdgeRow","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/UndirectedEdges","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/UndirectedIndexRow"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/first","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/second"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/DirectedGraph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/Graph-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TensorProductView","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TensorProductView","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"GraphProducts"}],"title":"TensorProductView","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView.swift#L41","fileName":"TensorProductView.swift"},"externalID":"s:13GraphProducts17TensorProductViewV","symbolKind":"struct"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphproducts\/tensorproductview"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tensor product G × H of two graphs, both directed or both undirected, as a lazy view. Made"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tensorProductView(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Also called the direct, categorical or Kronecker product."}],"references":{"doc://GraphProducts/documentation/GraphProducts/TensorProductView/UndirectedIndexRow":{"conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"First","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Graph","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"Second","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Graph","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"title":"TensorProductView.UndirectedIndexRow","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/UndirectedIndexRow","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UndirectedIndexRow"}],"url":"\/documentation\/graphproducts\/tensorproductview\/undirectedindexrow","abstract":[{"text":"An undirected row in index space, in the order of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UndirectedEdgeRow"},{"text":", with a factor","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"self-loop paired from its first appearance only. No hashing.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UndirectedIndexRow"}]},"doc://GraphProducts/documentation/GraphProducts/TensorProductView/Graph-Implementations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/Graph-Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/graphproducts\/tensorproductview\/graph-implementations","abstract":[],"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Graph Implementations","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://GraphProducts/documentation/GraphProducts/TensorProductView/Position":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Position"}],"title":"TensorProductView.Position","url":"\/documentation\/graphproducts\/tensorproductview\/position","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProducts\/documentation\/GraphProducts\/TensorProductView\/Position","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Position"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The position of an edge of a tensor product: the G-edge and the H-edge that generate it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text",